#=======================================================================
# Name                   : KGP_fetchSetId.scr
# Date                   : 05-12-2020
# Description            : To fetch the set id fro the given account
# MenuOption             : HTM/HPSP
# Author                 : Chethan Kumar D
# Called Script          : ofti1.mrt
# Calling Script         : NA
# Reference Document     : NA
# Modification History
# S.No.  Date          Name                 Description
